# upstream tests/unit on hxmc, from a copy of the suite (UpstreamSuites.hx):
# what every target compiles with (compile-each.hxml), the main of
# compile-hl.hxml and compile-cpp.hxml; each test announced (the runner
# counts them). UpstreamSuites adds hxmc's std (-cp bin/hxmc/std), the target
# and the skips (-D UTEST_PATTERN).
compile-each.hxml
--main unit.TestMain
-D UTEST_PRINT_TESTS
--custom-target hxmc=bin/hxmc/unit
